# Django

Django is a full-featured Python web framework.

It includes:

- URL routing
- Views
- Templates
- ORM
- Database migrations
- Authentication
- Admin interface
- Forms
- Security features
- Middleware
- Sessions
- CSRF protection

Django is excellent for building complete web applications.

---

## Django Architecture

A simplified Django application looks like:

Browser
    ↓
URL
    ↓
Django URL configuration
    ↓
View
    ↓
Business logic
    ↓
ORM
    ↓
Database
    ↓
Template / JSON response
    ↓
Browser

---

## Django URLs

Example:

from django.urls import path
from . import views

urlpatterns = [
    path("users/", views.users),
]

This connects:

/users/

to:

views.users

