## Development vs Production

Development:

- Debugging enabled
- Local database
- Local server
- Development settings
- Detailed errors

Production:

- Debugging disabled
- HTTPS
- Secure secrets
- Production database
- Logging
- Monitoring
- Proper application server
- Backups
- Security configuration

Never deploy a Django application with:

DEBUG = True

