# When To Use What

Use Django when:

- Building a complete website
- You need authentication
- You need a database
- You want an admin panel
- You need forms
- You want server-rendered HTML
- You want an ORM
- You want lots of functionality built in

Use FastAPI when:

- Building APIs
- Building backend services
- You want strong type-based validation
- You need async support
- You want automatic API documentation

Use Flask when:

- You want a lightweight framework
- You want maximum flexibility
- You're building a relatively small application
- You want to choose your own components

